OL,3,GNEWSAFirm says water safe despite
OL,4,Aresidents' complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in York say they continue to
OL,7,Fface problems with "vile-tasting" tap
OL,8,Fwater despite months of complaints.
OL,10,FPeople have described the water as
OL,11,F"undrinkable", saying it tasted and
OL,12,Fsmelled of chlorine, with some
OL,13,Fresorting to buying bottled water.
OL,15,FPosting on Facebook, one resident said:
OL,16,F"The water is absolutely vile. Run a
OL,17,Fbath and the whole upstairs smells like
OL,18,Fa swimming pool."
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
