OL,3,GNEWSAFirm says water safe despite
OL,4,Aresidents' complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Water said recent changes to
OL,7,Fthe way the city's water supply was
OL,8,Ftreated may have caused some customers
OL,9,Fto notice a difference in taste or
OL,10,Fsmell, but insisted it remained safe to
OL,11,Fdrink.
